[[3,47,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2891951\">5550C30</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Release the filter casing (1a) from the retainers (1b) and (1c),\nthen move it slightly (for the left lamp only).</p><p>2. Undo the bolts fixing the lamp.</p><p>3. Move the lamp and disconnect the electrical connections (3a,\n3b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3a</p></td><td><p>Left headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">F10A</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3a</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">F11A</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3b</p></td><td><p>Left headlamp alignment corrector motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890891\">N30</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3b</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp alignment corrector motor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890894\">N31</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035433.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,47,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the lamp is not\ndamaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections and\nrefit the lamp.</p><p>Tighten the bolts fixing the lamp.</p><p>Fasten the filter casing to its retainers\n(left lamp only).</p><p><a href=\"#/2891951\">5550C30</a>\n                                           .</p><p><a href=\"#/2891932\">5540B39</a>\n                                           .</p>"]]